\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S10}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {The gate with the baseline given Moirai's full $96{+}h$ history, on the \emph  {selection} windows.} The same fitted ridge in both columns; only how many of the available past steps it may use differs. MSE ratio is $\text  {MSE}_{96+h}/\text  {MSE}_{96}$, so below $1$ means the extra history made the baseline stronger. Bold clears $0.20$. Generated by \texttt  {scripts/matched\_lookback\_gate.py --split val}.}}{10}{table.caption.10}\protected@file@percent }
